      ],
      "en": "We have written your name on everything in tears."
    },
    {
      "start": 214.08,
      "end": 222.28,
      "lines": [
        "Ye raaste, ghar, galiyaan tumhein kar na sake salaam"
      ],
      "en": "These roads, houses and lanes never got to bid you farewell."
    },
    {
      "start": 222.28,
      "end": 226.84,
      "lines": [
